<https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/technologies/printing-finishing-equipment/wide-format-printers/hp> a skos:Concept ;
    dcterms:created "2026-05-18T12:24:03+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    dcterms:creator "https://ptpge.org/contributors/ptpge" ;
    dcterms:license <https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/> ;
    dcterms:modified "2026-10-09T10:30:00+00:00"^^xsd:dateTime ;
    skos:broader <https://ptpge.org/v1/printing/technologies/printing-finishing-equipment/wide-format-printers> ;
    skos:definition "Hewlett-Packard (HP) — storformatlinje, der omfatter Latex (vandbaseret til indendørs/udendørs skiltning), DesignJet (teknisk og grafisk) og PageWide XL (teknisk tryk i storformat)."@da,
        "Hewlett-Packard (HP) — Großformatdrucker-Linie einschließlich Latex (wasserbasiert für Innen- und Außenbeschilderung), DesignJet (Technik und Grafikkunst) und PageWide XL (technischer Großformatdruck)."@de,
        "Hewlett-Packard (HP) — wide-format printer line including Latex (water-based for indoor/outdoor signage), DesignJet (technical and graphic arts), and PageWide XL (large-format technical printing)."@en,
        "HP — fabricante de impresoras de gran formato bajo las marcas DesignJet (CAD, fotografía) y Latex (signage eco-solvente con tinta látex acuosa)."@es,
        "Hewlett-Packard (HP) — वाइड-फॉर्मेट प्रिंटर श्रृंखला जिसमें Latex (इनडोर/आउटडोर साइनेज के लिए जल-आधारित), DesignJet (तकनीकी और ग्राफ़िक आर्ट्स) और PageWide XL (लार्ज-फॉर्मेट तकनीकी छपाई) शामिल।"@hi,
        "ヒューレット・パッカード（HP）— Latex（屋内外サイン用の水性）、DesignJet（技術およびグラフィックアーツ）、PageWide XL（大判技術印刷）を含む大判プリンターライン。"@ja,
        "Hewlett-Packard (HP) — storformat-skriverlinje inkludert Latex (vannbasert for innendørs/utendørs skilting), DesignJet (teknisk og grafisk kunst) og PageWide XL (storformat teknisk trykk)."@nb,
        "Hewlett-Packard (HP) — grootformaatlijn met Latex (waterbasis voor binnen-/buitensignalisatie), DesignJet (technisch en grafisch) en PageWide XL (technisch drukwerk in groot formaat)."@nl,
        "Hewlett-Packard (HP) — linia drukarek wielkoformatowych obejmująca Latex (wodne atramenty do oznakowania wewnętrznego/zewnętrznego), DesignJet (techniczne i sztuki graficzne) oraz PageWide XL (wielkoformatowy druk techniczny)."@pl,
        "Hewlett-Packard (HP) — linha de impressoras de grande formato que inclui Latex (à base de água para sinalização interna/externa), DesignJet (técnica e artes gráficas) e PageWide XL (impressão técnica de grande formato)."@pt,
        "Hewlett-Packard (HP) — storformatslinje som omfattar Latex (vattenbaserad för inomhus-/utomhusskyltning), DesignJet (teknisk och grafisk) och PageWide XL (tekniskt tryck i storformat)."@sv,
        "HP —— 在DesignJet（CAD、摄影）和Latex（带水基乳胶油墨的环保溶剂标识）品牌下制造大幅面打印机。"@zh-Hans ;
    skos:inScheme <https://ptpge.org/v1/scheme> ;
    skos:notation "P:TC-PFE-WIDE-HPWF" ;
    skos:prefLabel "HP"@da,
        "HP"@de,
        "HP"@en,
        "HP"@es,
        "HP"@hi,
        "HP"@ja,
        "HP"@nb,
        "HP"@nl,
        "HP"@pl,
        "HP"@pt,
        "HP"@sv,
        "HP"@zh-Hans ;
    ptpge:deprecatedOn "2026-10-06"^^xsd:date ;
    ptpge:deprecationReason "Company names leave the vocabulary (SD-0097, 2026-10-06; SD-0101, 2026-10-09): a maker's identity is a register entry under /v1/suppliers/, created when the company claims it at ptpge.org/adopt, and its series and models live in its own catalogue. No register entry exists yet for this maker. This URI keeps resolving."@en,
        "Firmanavn går ut av vokabularet (SD-0097, 2026-10-06; SD-0101, 2026-10-09): en produsents identitet er en registeroppføring under /v1/suppliers/, opprettet når selskapet gjør identiteten gjeldende på ptpge.org/adopt, og serier og modeller lever i dens egen katalog. Ingen registeroppføring finnes ennå for denne produsenten. Denne URI-en fortsetter å svare."@nb ;
    ptpge:group "technologies" ;
    ptpge:level "sub-category" ;
    ptpge:status "deprecated" ;
    ptpge:version "2026-10-06" .

